WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.599
In the Shortcuts library, open ことり (Kotori).

2
00:00:06.599 --> 00:00:14.484
Touch and hold one of the three preset recording options. This example uses 記録を追加 (Record Entry).

3
00:00:14.484 --> 00:00:23.262
Choose ホーム画面に追加 (Add to Home Screen), then tap the checkmark.

4
00:00:23.262 --> 00:00:30.000
Next time, just tap 記録を追加 (Record Entry) on the Home Screen.

5
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Enter a description and amount, then tap Done. For example, ランチ1200円 (lunch, 1,200 yen).

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:43.200
The entry was added without opening the app. Review the pending entry later in Transactions.
